position_not_restored.description:
The tracker saves your aircraft's last position so the map shows it after a restart. The saved file exists but could not be used, so the map has no position until your next flight.

Error: {error}

Nothing needs doing: this clears by itself the next time a position is saved, which happens when you are next connected to VATSIM. If it comes back after every restart, please report it with the log lines for vatsim_atc.
